{"id":574,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Even when nobody seems to be around, Gothita can still be heard making a muted cry. Many believe it’s speaking to something only it can see."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Though they’re still only babies, there’s psychic power stored in their ribbonlike feelers, and sometimes they use that power to fight."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White"],"text":"They intently observe both Trainers and Pokémon. Apparently, they are looking at something that only Gothita can see."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Black"],"text":"Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power. They are always staring at something."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It stares intently at everything. It can become so obsessed with watching that it doesn’t notice attacks."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Frisk","hidden":false,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon can check an opposing Pokémon's held item."},{"name":"Competitive","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Sp. Atk stat sharply when its stats are lowered by an opposing Pokémon."},{"name":"Shadow Tag","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon steps on the opposing Pokémon's shadows to prevent them from fleeing or switching out."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":6,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Purple","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":574,"name":"Gothita","condition":null,"children":[{"id":575,"name":"Gothorita","condition":"Lv. 32","children":[{"id":576,"name":"Gothitelle","condition":"Lv. 41","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,1],[1,93],[4,589],[8,321],[12,60],[16,204],[20,473],[24,95],[28,313],[33,244],[36,94],[40,260],[44,248],[48,478]],"machine":[347,204,399,203,412,797,263,313,374,492,248,447,356,270,286,113,417,182,60,244,94,917,678,473,240,115,156,157,317,247,285,214,500,164,129,269,851,168,86,85,271,433,428],"egg":[252,505,212,243,259],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"